      "findings": [
        {
          "id": "F1-RP-001",
          "severity": "blocking",
          "blockingAuthority": "author",
          "title": "FinalCandidatePreflight 只捕获当前 HEAD，未证明该 HEAD 属于已通过 Full Test/Architecture 的 qualified candidate",
          "problem": "078 将 finalizationQualificationRef 绑定 Full Test authorization/result 与 architecture disposition，但不绑定 Git revision；Finalize preflight 随后仅要求 index empty、HEAD stable、dirty paths bounded，并把当时的 current HEAD 直接写入 candidateRef。这样如果在 Full Test passed（以及 architectureImpact=true 时 Actual/Compare/Owner acceptance）之后发生一个 clean ordinary Git commit，working tree/index 仍然可以完全干净，preflight 会把这个新 HEAD 当作合法 candidate base。旧 Full Test/architecture qualification 不会自动失效，candidateRef 反而会对未经该 qualification 验证的新 HEAD 重新定锚。",
          "contractRef": "Flowkit Explore Skill v2 §4.2 Temporal Proof, §4.7 External Mutation Proof, §5 Proof Acceptance Depth; Flowkit Operating Model v8 Git boundary / Delivery Finalize authority; 03 v6 F1 finalization preconditions and exact Delivery Final identity",
          "invariant": "Delivery Finalize 的 candidate base Git revision 必须属于当前 Full Test/Architecture qualification 覆盖的 exact final repository candidate。Finalize preflight 不能把一个 qualification 之后才出现的普通 clean commit 仅因为 worktree/index clean 就吸收到新的 candidateRef。",
          "requiredOutcome": "Revise Proposal，使 FinalCandidatePreflight 在 active->completed 前 exact-bind candidate base HEAD 到当前 qualification 覆盖的正式 Git revision/boundary，而不是仅捕获任意 current HEAD。Reviewer 不限定唯一实现；可以采用 recognized latest pre-final Git boundary、accepted Actual repositoryRevision（适用时）+ 等价 not-applicable规则、或其他能覆盖两种 architecture applicability 的 deterministic fail-closed机制。",
          "acceptance": [
            "增加 disposable/prospective proof：Full Test passed（architectureImpact=true 时再完成 Actual/Compare/acceptance）后创建一个 ordinary clean Git commit，Finalize MUST 在 Manifest mutation 前失败。",
            "architectureImpact=true 与 false 两个分支都必须证明 clean post-qualification commit 不能被旧 qualification吸收到新的 candidateRef。",
            "合法 candidate仍应允许 Delivery-level dirty bytes仅限 Manifest + applicable Actual，并保持 index empty；不要错误要求这些未提交 Delivery-level bytes提前存在于 base commit。",
            "candidate base identity必须来自正式可验证 Git boundary/revision，而不是 caller输入或聊天状态。",
            "成功 Finalize 后 crash/resume handoff、strict Delivery Final admission和 no-auto-commit authority边界保持不变。"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
